{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"chain_fiend","model_identifier":"chain_fiend","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# chain_fiend\n\nChain fiend (C2), climber, 2.4 m = 85 u to the top of the head (shoulder spikes and horns to 88 u).\n\nA lean, long-limbed red demon wrapped in black chains (chest, waist, forearms, thighs) with a hooked chain end hanging from its belt, long black-clawed hands and feet, black spikes on both shoulders, little horns, a fanged mouth and burning yellow eyes. It carries a barbed throwing hook on a short chain in its right hand. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled, lean).\n\n- Cubes: 40 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..87.5, z -11.0..4.2 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 20 x 86 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `climb` | 1 | loop | in place, facing the wall at -Z (wall face about 6 u in front of the origin); loop |\n| `attack_claw` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: two-handed claw rake down across the target |\n| `throw_hook` | 1.6 | once | key 0.95 s: the hook leaves the right hand (the held hook scales to 0 at 0.97): spawn `chain_hook` at slot_hand_r and draw chain_link pieces back to the hand |\n| `pull` | 1.6 | once | starts with the hook out; big yank key 0.5 s (second yank 1.0) drags the hooked unit off the wall; the hook is reeled back into the hand at 1.27 s |\n| `aggro` | 1.3 | once | arms spread, claws flexed, head back |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 54.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 142.2 u/s (4.00 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 93.9 u per cycle\n- `climb`: 1.0 m/s = 36 u/s straight up (loop is in place)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_claw`: key 0.45 s: two-handed claw rake down across the target\n- `throw_hook`: key 0.95 s: the hook leaves the right hand (the held hook scales to 0 at 0.97): spawn `chain_hook` at slot_hand_r and draw chain_link pieces back to the hand\n- `pull`: starts with the hook out; big yank key 0.5 s (second yank 1.0) drags the hooked unit off the wall; the hook is reeled back into the hand at 1.27 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 85, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 62, 5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 67.5, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5.5, 74.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 59.5, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10, 33, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-13.25, 46, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10, 33, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6.5, 47, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6.5, 47, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `held_hook` (visible, under slot_hand_r): short chain + barbed hook, about 14 u; hidden (scale 0) while thrown in throw_hook / pull\n- `belt_chain` (bone on the hips): decorative hanging chain end with a hook, swings in idle/walk/run/climb\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Uses `scale` keys on held_hook.\n"},"description":"# chain_fiend\n\nChain fiend (C2), climber, 2.4 m = 85 u to the top of the head (shoulder spikes and horns to 88 u).\n\nA lean, long-limbed red demon wrapped in black chains (chest, waist, forearms, thighs) with a hooked chain end hanging from its belt, long black-clawed hands and feet, black spikes on both shoulders, little horns, a fanged mouth and burning yellow eyes. It carries a barbed throwing hook on a short chain in its right hand. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled, lean).\n\n- Cubes: 40 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..87.5, z -11.0..4.2 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 20 x 86 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.66 | loop |  |\n| `climb` | 1 | loop | in place, facing the wall at -Z (wall face about 6 u in front of the origin); loop |\n| `attack_claw` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: two-handed claw rake down across the target |\n| `throw_hook` | 1.6 | once | key 0.95 s: the hook leaves the right hand (the held hook scales to 0 at 0.97): spawn `chain_hook` at slot_hand_r and draw chain_link pieces back to the hand |\n| `pull` | 1.6 | once | starts with the hook out; big yank key 0.5 s (second yank 1.0) drags the hooked unit off the wall; the hook is reeled back into the hand at 1.27 s |\n| `aggro` | 1.3 | once | arms spread, claws flexed, head back |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 54.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 142.2 u/s (4.00 m/s), cycle 0.66 s, 93.9 u per cycle\n- `climb`: 1.0 m/s = 36 u/s straight up (loop is in place)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_claw`: key 0.45 s: two-handed claw rake down across the target\n- `throw_hook`: key 0.95 s: the hook leaves the right hand (the held hook scales to 0 at 0.97): spawn `chain_hook` at slot_hand_r and draw chain_link pieces back to the hand\n- `pull`: starts with the hook out; big yank key 0.5 s (second yank 1.0) drags the hooked unit off the wall; the hook is reeled back into the hand at 1.27 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 85, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 62, 5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 67.5, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5.5, 74.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 59.5, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10, 33, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-13.25, 46, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10, 33, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6.5, 47, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6.5, 47, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `held_hook` (visible, under slot_hand_r): short chain + barbed hook, about 14 u; hidden (scale 0) while thrown in throw_hook / pull\n- `belt_chain` (bone on the hips): decorative hanging chain end with a hook, swings in idle/walk/run/climb\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Uses `scale` keys on held_hook.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,44.0,-3.0],"to":[5.5,50.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30,50,41.0,56.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[74,50,80.0,56.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[41,50,52.0,56.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[80,50,86.0,56.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[52,50,63.0,56.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[63,50,74.0,56.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b3aa6d6e-851a-5e53-87fe-4b999f664a76"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.5,50.0,-3.5],"to":[7.5,73.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,50.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,15.0,23.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[30,0,37.0,23.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[15,0,30.0,23.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[37,0,44.0,23.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,50,15.0,57.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[15,50,30.0,57.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"78683c6f-960d-51e3-9550-dafeac5fbe16"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,